flowchart TD
    A["User runs: init"]
    B["Prompt: Enter master password"]
    C["Validate password strength"]
    C_fail["Reject: weak password"]
    C_ok["Continue"]

    D["Generate random salt"]
    E["Derive KEK via Argon2id<br/>m=64MiB, t=3, p=1"]
    F["Generate random 32B DEK"]

    G["Wrap DEK: Path 1 - Password<br/>chacha20poly1305 with KEK"]
    H["Wrap DEK: Path 2 - Recovery Code<br/>Generate high-entropy code"]
    I["Wrap DEK: Path 3 - DPAPI<br/>Machine-scope KEK storage"]

    J["Display recovery code<br/>User confirms receipt<br/>code saved to clipboard"]
    K["Require user confirm<br/>offline backup"]
    K_fail["Abort: code not confirmed"]
    K_ok["Continue"]

    L["Generate offline ed25519<br/>signing key pair"]
    M["Encrypt config secrets<br/>using DEK"]
    N["Save wrapped DEK paths<br/>+ encrypted config to file"]

    O["Test roundtrip:<br/>encrypt secret → decrypt → verify"]
    O_fail["Fail: crypto error"]
    O_ok["Success"]

    P["Register DPAPI KEK<br/>to OS keystore"]
    Q["Display completion summary"]
    R["Success: keys initialized"]

    C -->|Valid| C_ok
    C -->|Weak| C_fail
    C_fail --> B

    C_ok --> D
    D --> E
    E --> F
    F --> G
    G --> H
    H --> I
    I --> J
    J --> K
    K -->|Not confirmed| K_fail
    K -->|Confirmed| K_ok

    K_ok --> L
    L --> M
    M --> N
    N --> O
    O -->|Failed| O_fail
    O_fail --> B
    O -->|Passed| O_ok

    O_ok --> P
    P --> Q
    Q --> R

    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style R fill:#c8e6c9
    style C_fail fill:#ffcdd2
    style K_fail fill:#ffcdd2
    style O_fail fill:#ffcdd2
